    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d559">

                <pb facs="0684" n="602" xml:id="pg602"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Romero</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department Of State,
                            Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-11-02"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 2, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Sir: I have the honor to acknowledge your communications of March 31, and April 3
                    and 7, 1865, with their respective enclosures, transmitting, for the information
                    of this government, accounts of the condition of affairs in Mexico, and of the
                    events occurring there connected with the operations of the forces contending in
                    that republic.</p>
                <p>You will be pleased to accept my grateful acknowledgments for the interesting
                    information you have so kindly communicated, while I avail myself of the
                    occasion to reiterate to you, sir, the assurances of my high consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matias Romero</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c. Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
